
###
### USERS

### Retrieve all users
GET http://{{host}}/v1/users

### Retrieve 2-nd page (size=2) of users
GET http://{{host}}/v1/users?
    sort=id&
    order=asc&
    pageNumber=1&
    numOfRecords=2

### Retrieve single user
GET http://{{host}}/v1/users/3

### Insert user
POST http://{{host}}/v1/users
Accept: application/json, application/*+json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1003,
  "name": "Carlos Updated",
  "surname": "Gonzalez"
}

### Update user
PUT http://{{host}}/v1/users
Accept: application/json, application/*+json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "name": "Carlos UPDATE",
  "surname": "Gonzalez UPDATED"
}


### Delete user
DELETE http://{{host}}/v1/users/4

###
### CARS

### Retrieve all cars
GET http://{{host}}/v1/cars

### Retrieve 2-nd page (size=2) of users
GET http://{{host}}/v1/cars?
    sort=id&
    order=asc&
    pageNumber=1&
    numOfRecords=2

### Retrieve car with given id
GET http://{{host}}/v1/cars/7

### Insert car
POST http://{{host}}/v1/cars
Accept: application/json, application/*+json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1003,
  "type": "SEDAN",
  "model": "Mustang",
  "make": "Ford"
}


### Update car
PUT http://{{host}}/v1/cars
Accept: application/json, application/*+json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 7,
  "type": "SEDAN",
  "model": "Mustang updated",
  "make": "Ford updated"
}


### Delete given car
DELETE http://{{host}}/v1/cars/7

###
### RESERVATIONS

## Get reservations for user
GET http://{{host}}/v1/reservations/user/3

### Make reservation of particular type for user between dates
POST  http://{{host}}/v1/reservations
Accept: application/json, application/*+json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "carType": "SEDAN",
  "startTime": "2025-07-01T11:00:00",
  "numOfDays": 2

}